-- (contracts/schema.md, contracts/permissions.md `admin:backlog`; REQ-ADM-01, REQ-ADM-02)
--
-- Tables and enums below were generated by drizzle-kit from db/schema/backlog.ts; the
-- updated_at trigger, RLS and the `admin-attachments` bucket are appended by hand.
--
-- Deploy safety: this migration only adds things (two enums, three tables, one trigger
-- function, policies on the new tables, one bucket and its storage policies). Nothing the
-- live build reads or writes changes, so it is safe to apply while that build is serving.

